        "quote_count": 27,
        "reply_count": 69,
        "retweet_count": 164
      },
      "text": "Was great talking with @marthamaccallum after today's hearing on how America can win on AI. https://t.co/xdEXkyT4Jd",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1910158972977291425"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2025-04-10T01:11:25.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1910138517419630899"
      ],
      "entities": {
        "mentions": [
          {
            "end": 81,
            "id": "46648807",
            "start": 76,
            "username": "NIST"
          }
        ]
      },
      "id": "1910138517419630899",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "615818451",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 18,
        "impression_count": 63692,
        "like_count": 181,
        "quote_count": 1,
        "reply_count": 13,
        "retweet_count": 14
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1910138515632816136",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "4. Promote:\n\nwe need to promote U.S. technology globally. We should empower @NIST to build standards and share across the Network of Global AI Safety Institutes.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1910138517419630899"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2025-04-10T01:11:25.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1910138515632816136"
      ],
      "id": "1910138515632816136",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "615818451",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 15,
        "impression_count": 51635,
        "like_count": 169,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 10,
        "retweet_count": 10
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1910138513883791451",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "3. Innovate:\n\nAmerica must support innovation from companies. Best framework allows innovation while still creating guardrails. Congress should take a use-case based reg approach, set federal AI governance standards, and  prepare American workers for an AI-driven future.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1910138515632816136"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2025-04-10T01:11:25.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1910138513883791451"
      ],
      "id": "1910138513883791451",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "615818451",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 12,
        "impression_count": 17676,
        "like_count": 99,
        "quote_count": 1,
        "reply_count": 5,
        "retweet_count": 8
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1910138511287607665",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "2. Unleash:\n\nWe must unleash AI technology and establish an Agentic Government. For ex, we should use AI to improve vet healthcare, improve IRS fraud detection, and agency efficiency. We could also require agencies to establish flagship AI programs.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1910138513883791451"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2025-04-10T01:11:24.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1910138511287607665"
      ],
      "id": "1910138511287607665",
      "in_reply_to_user_id": "615818451",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 13,
        "impression_count": 18957,
        "like_count": 110,
        "quote_count": 2,
        "reply_count": 9,
        "retweet_count": 10
      },
      "referenced_tweets": [
        {
          "id": "1910138509140049993",
          "type": "replied_to"
        }
      ],
      "text": "1. Dominate:\n\nWe need to establish Data Dominance. We can do this by setting up a National AI Data Reserve, making all govt data AI-ready, and investing to position data dominance as a national priority.",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1910138511287607665"
    },
    {
      "attachments": {
        "media_keys": [
          "13_1910138341896445952"
        ]
      },
      "author_id": "615818451",
      "created_at": "2025-04-10T01:11:23.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "1910138509140049993"
      ],
      "entities": {
        "mentions": [
          {
            "end": 37,
            "id": "114756202",
            "start": 23,
            "username": "HouseCommerce"
          }
        ]
      },
      "id": "1910138509140049993",
      "public_metrics": {
        "bookmark_count": 761,
        "impression_count": 344094,
        "like_count": 2425,
        "quote_count": 46,
        "reply_count": 129,
        "retweet_count": 348
      },
      "text": "I testified at today's @HouseCommerce hearing on AI.\n\nThe CCP has an AI master plan that’s working.\n\nI told Congress that America must do the following to win on AI: Dominate, Unleash, Innovate, Promote. \n\n🧵 https://t.co/ZfEpFhA7Gi",
      "url": "https://x.com/alexandr_wang/status/1910138509140049993"
    },
