        },
        "referenced_tweets": [
          {
            "id": "1910138511287607665",
            "type": "replied_to"
          }
        ],
        "text": "2. Unleash:\n\nWe must unleash AI technology and establish an Agentic Government. For ex, we should use AI to improve vet healthcare, improve IRS fraud detection, and agency efficiency. We could also require agencies to establish flagship AI programs."
      },
      {
        "author_id": "615818451",
